SUMMARY:AnimeGen v3.0.0
DESCRIPTION:AnimeGen 3.0.0 | AnimeGen\n\n# Finally AnimeGen v3.0.0. is here
 !\n\nTook me a bit but i finally recoded the app completely. No new source
 s but they were all improved a lot. \nSome sources got removed since they 
 were not working at lot for a lot of time.\n\nThe UI now is more simple an
 d made to work all on the bottom of the screen.\nThe app size is now 3 tim
 es smaller. The only real issue anyone could find is that it cant save .gi
 f images yet.\n\nYou can either sideload the ipa or install AnimeGen via [
 TestFlight](https://testflight.apple.com/join/jqx2hEkN)\n\n> [!Important]\
 n> The NSFW option has been removed and it will **never return back**
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/animegen.json
